OL,4,CTriple killer 'beat Huntley dead in    
OL,5,Ccold blood'                            
OL,6,GA triple murderer beat Soham child-    
OL,7,Gkiller Ian Huntley to death with a     
OL,8,Gmetal bar in a "cold-blooded" attack   
OL,9,Gat the jail where they were both       
OL,10,Gserving life sentences, a jury has     
OL,11,Gheard.                                 
OL,13,FAnthony Russell, 44, denies murdering  
OL,14,FHuntley, 52, in a recycling workshop   
OL,15,Fat the high security Frankland Prison, 
OL,16,Fnear Durham, in February, but admits   
OL,17,Fmanslaughter.                          
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
