OL,4,CCities bid to host Women's World Cup   
OL,5,Cmatches                                
OL,6,GTwo cities in the North East of        
OL,7,GEngland are bidding to host matches at 
OL,8,Gthe 2035 Women's World Cup, after Fifa 
OL,9,Gconfirmed the tournament will take     
OL,10,Gplace across the four nations of the   
OL,11,GUK.                                    
OL,13,FNewcastle and Sunderland are among and 
OL,14,Finitial list of 19 potential venues    
OL,15,Falong with another 12 stadia in        
OL,16,FEngland, one in Northern Ireland, two  
OL,17,Fin Scotland and two in Wales.          
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
