OL,4,CCockerel dumping rise despite          
OL,5,Callotment ban U-turn                   
OL,6,GCockerel dumping has increased despite 
OL,7,Ga council overturning its decision to  
OL,8,Gban the birds from allotments, a       
OL,9,Grescuer said.                          
OL,11,FFounder of Darlington Bird Rescue      
OL,12,FLaura Hewitt said the number of        
OL,13,Fabandoned cockerels had increased      
OL,14,F"exponentially" since Durham County    
OL,15,FCouncil banned the birds on its        
OL,16,Fallotments in March and gave owners 12 
OL,17,Fmonths to adhere to the rule.          
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
